                                "example_id": "810d3379-939a-4483-a776-da3ea7c3ccd5",
                                "sense_id": "656b1437-4079-3fe9-b346-d921a6321810",
                                "text": "Baby, baby, that's the way it goes\n Nothing happens when you Mash Potatoes\n I just gotta fall in love with you\nWatusi is the dance to do\n Wah-a, wah, wah-a Watusi\n C'mon and take a chance and get-a with this dance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d393fd4c-bb38-4060-8a30-0196cdfc49d8",
                                "sense_id": "656b1437-4079-3fe9-b346-d921a6321810",
                                "text": "Twist it in the alley\n With long tall Sally\n Twistin' with Lucy\n Doin' the watusi."
                            }
                        ]
